            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SYRUP AND THE ULTIMATE SWEET</strong> is a visual novel originally made for YuriJam 2015! It's about a candy alchemist, Syrup, who one day finds a candy golem in her basement workshop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where did she come from?? Who the heck made her????? GO FIND OUT!!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 endings, 5 good and 5 bad</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1-2 hours completion time (~16k word count)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A nyan-binary cat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bonus gallery with concept art and illustrations (matches the console version)</p></li></ul>",
